    "content_noencode": "<section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">你好，我是郭震</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">昨天看到几个博主分享Agent制作短视频，我看得手痒。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">今天我也体验了一把，分别生成了类似老友记那样情景短剧，汽车TVC短片，电商商品宣传，以及AI短剧。</span></span></section><section><section><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">Wow，这个效果我没想到，它们已经达到直接发布级水准。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">很兴奋，于是有了这篇实测文章，感兴趣的可以看看。</span></span></section></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);font-weight: bold;\">1 作品展示</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">我创建这些作品，使用的是LibTV，这个视频Agent内置了100+视频Skill，拿来即用：</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040008\" data-ratio=\"0.45740740740740743\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDic7NsfaC77DNM4cb2o5QdwhZM4PqlHWZ1e1FhJW2uXWUZ3xDZWImHY11rfuuX9URyLqz9OcibgaXJCR3bJibo52zs4Nb4qv77u4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></span></section><section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">每个 Skill 都可以理解为一位专业 AI 导演，如下图选中它，一句提示词：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040086\" data-ratio=\"0.36574074074074076\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDRrcnVhccJdd0emFDSrasdD2pZ57LGuKxMRZcRcT7jr2y7g6weHp5YAWytlzMOD8mBib8xyN7QDYOZG2joFSicBVEcrIppcrVrw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">就生成下面的情景喜剧短视频，因为我平时喜欢看情景喜剧学口语，很多地道表达放进具体场景里更容易记住：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4605116761494011904\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4605116761494011904\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYD2icsNV4Yf4kvbKNN6GcuiccQlyHxPW5I0XCsW4vnZeEt02uKHRGD5WuBUSiaVgsbljMfv5Ot0SCVysm8tF2QH8FxEtxa890TXhs%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1280\"></iframe></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">除了做了双人电梯对话，我还遥控LibTV当导演，制作了类似老友记那样的四人客厅群戏：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4605114930395234308\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4605114930395234308\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYAUsES6dUibia3EKCMSIyiaG3snlUp5O1gcFgI72qmWhbNx9W5lHvYbRJAC9stL5mXHOAV8eGlxy1619CouLE6ZXCddOQYXLsLAFA%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">做完看的我挺爽，制作过程中，我还重点观察</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">了下目前先进的 Agent 能不能处理好口语对白、人物反应和连续笑点，结果让我信服了。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">过了把制作情景喜剧短视频的瘾后，我还玩了把AI短剧，使用LibTV里的A24 美学Skill，生成了如下精致而克制的短片：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4605124871063355400\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4605124871063355400\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYCJoHqcAsPiceiaVrvCFqueVuulKRaFFWu9INDrY0m27O67ND9qicfHlrLGMAy8QJtJ2PeE8SccSsCibQN3PGziajOAxZqJGdy07Z7M%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1280\"></iframe></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">视频时长1分左右，这里面的人物表演、镜头氛围与情绪推进，还带有一些小惊悚，过瘾！</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">试过真人创作类短视频后，我又玩了把使用卡通形象宣传面包，最近电商场景很多人都在制作此类短视频：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040088\" data-ratio=\"0.36574074074074076\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYBQG130CQriadsyibbliaUZgntBO3fyf0t08g6ZibugP1veG9CbrZiawlGlQhjiado6ayxra72k3yJ0kbed0WXlIBLZkVQTzER8NpBibU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">选择LibTV内置的皮克斯动画广告Skill，加载一张喜欢的卡通人物图，如图所示一句简单的提示词，过一会儿就生成如下喜人的卡通短视频，把门店制作面包过程展示出来：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4605120571734114304\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4605120571734114304\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYDHiawDjP51G2e9QsOMRO8pFN9QHgVNzmhtAVvjZg1evIpgE9WRpqnRWhLU1hB20BZgByBDBeLRSNgWZ1o76cEp8ibOPIBv35Fa4%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1280\"></iframe></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">接下来我想试试商业视频里更考验运镜、速度感和产品质感的汽车TVC。对品牌团队来说，这类内容很常用，我想看看只给一句提示词，它能不能完成一条有高级感的汽车广告：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4605125358659796998\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4605125358659796998\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYCibo02KiaSeKkcUf63icG0k2VKjYcE8QS78NbB35GHu51TWDey1ASa2oA3AX3L1l91FyMT4uB7EplbRkBIRn83sia4TKHNnOyEMj8%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1280\"></iframe></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">几条片子做下来，我觉得 LibTV 的成片质量确实挺高：选一个 Skill，再给一句需求，它就能交付接近发布状态的完整视频。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">接下来，我把背后的制作流程摊开，看看 Agent 具体做了什么，以及遇到视频节奏问题时，我是怎么让它继续修改的。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);font-weight: bold;\">2 从零制作短视频</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">这节主要介绍LibTV使用的核心逻辑，看完这节你也能做出上面的视频。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">首先进入 liblib.tv 后，选择开始创作：</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040007\" data-ratio=\"0.4351851851851852\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYBMrgzyAlyYWBUj8csdED7gG19aS8DrsKbxCMmXNO1VJ5NiamAPvqEwJiaUnv2ib0xWMmiacXM4vlUpL7URM47ZVrlHiaK0hkrrqmsw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">进入后选择情景喜剧Skill，一句如下提示词：</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040089\" data-ratio=\"0.40555555555555556\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYBO3ocakXcy0hSwETruMulCLSQlRuQ1SibA9fl0WKUgPTRW3ibJ8vdWfU6w8tPmtq1cezJiaYl4n2gicrvibVmxovO0kzh61upF75Y8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">大家做短视频最头疼的问题之一就是制作分镜，这个</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">视频Agent都能自动创建：</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040090\" data-ratio=\"0.562037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDsibp3GWYj8CicJo07icXXfI7FBwoicZzX8iadgA04V91aHlIqnDggXT6r2BI2o3lPy2HibpszVicyGibEVM8RUeI78UZsuGvzfb7Ay5w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><br  /></span></section><section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">就连视频中的多个</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">核心锚点也都搞定，如下自动创建4个人物角色三视图：</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040091\" data-ratio=\"0.7210884353741497\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYC8JRMEaiaAuSvH66lb2CN3c2PVicWt8ReQ6y5iaxboPnkcDYGZtzQsgicic4jweGicLGlMt2b3Kic6XsU4Cly7JmOaficg1ndLk6SCbKA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"882\" type=\"block\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">之后逐步生成每个分镜的视频：</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040092\" data-ratio=\"0.7873563218390804\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDfGIVgyyK7LmR97VzT9rT0IATFqgEJGGJJHapW4vD61iaEUic6ClGrSRkmz3NX13GOOP8hiaupqLYLSJCHJgF0ibjeibYCRkxlFRibY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"870\" type=\"block\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">最后合并成片，声音和字幕也都包括进去了，详见文章开头的第二个视频。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">大家看到这就是它家的这个Agent，从任务规划，再到文本，图片，声音，视频，字幕一连串生成。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: bold;\">实话讲，我一直都很期待这样的Agent，能端到端成片！</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">熟悉我的读者知道，我在做本地知识库Agent，需要和优秀的产品学习，它家的下面右侧智能体工作面板+搭配左侧AI画布，尤其这个AI画布就对我带来了灵感：</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040095\" data-ratio=\"0.5601851851851852\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYBceicFWIbTvCrkGqgnYaA5RndNSqjlmLJqUictrBPCO3Yxe0nOJltFwtlr1vbXtO8201cP94ANzwWIQaRteibXTyicHWkrKnk7uaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">智能体边工作，边在左侧自动创建AI工作流，这种可观测性就比较流畅，同时还可以编辑每个节点，这为二次修改提供很大便利。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">比如点击工作流中的某个分片节点，上面弹出 剪辑，裁剪，高清，解析等二次编辑按钮：</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040096\" data-ratio=\"0.5972222222222222\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYD5g0HNCiazXozGsmnC9esAiaO0IcL5BC2WfFiaKYMdKFkSu9Lz0V7QAvQRzArOdJRz9YLlxVM2QrBb4tcicwdzdODW3Hptic4lzqtw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></section></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">比如在生成这条视频时，我发现人物静止时间稍微长了1-2秒钟，那我就可以使用剪辑按钮，直接cut掉。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">除了工作流界面，还支持故事版，可以按照文本和视频顺序逐个预览和二次编辑：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDSmuRteBOXblpuat2VWvw24FOgox4eeKp5YQunH07mDqXPotuA265icAcUzPOr8RMZk5Kic20HstI1IibibFeibxrdqdEC10yuc758/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5203703703703704\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100040097\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">我的体感，感觉工作流+故事版，这种双模式为视频创作后期带来了很大便利。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">以上就是LibTV的主要使用逻辑，哦对了，还有一个支持自定义Skill，从而更便捷制作专属你的视频。接下来我来说下怎么做。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);font-weight: bold;\">3 自定义Skill生成连续AI短剧</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">还记得上高中那回看好莱坞大片，挺让人震撼的，但没想到现在我也能通过Agent来做了。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">如下就是我自己创建的电影级科幻连续短剧导演Skill：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100040019\" data-ratio=\"0.7046296296296296\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDo0wynLetTDWqQVEg9ttkkWiaUgCEP6CGrOzwsx5QkyeeKdyqoNibTKTUuyiaicjCgpgndJ1iaGmYLKRZhsFRWa1Qhb1seJMzmCN24/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">你可以去LibTV，搜索我写的这个skill，直接引用它：</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDg79ByE2A2M973L9icszLCW0htW533WjzXdlqYY2deXX4MsPSflz2coiaXf7ybJRvNlicH17iaIuichniczFwE2Icd0b0Ik1MGR3IqQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4164490861618799\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"766\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100040045\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">就能像我一样，开启多集AI短剧创作之路。</span></span></p></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">所以今天我就直接把编写的提示词难度，直接打到零，如下所示，只需要at我写的这个skill，生成科幻短剧这几个字，过一会儿第一集《建立信任》就出来了：</span></span></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4603360496283779075\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4603360496283779075\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYBcQKggkfKTqrJNFyRygTagGbicpTdKSwBNf3ibjJNnANwYiawvSGCr94Nb3cYE8r74dQeBYya5UY8mRnMp7Paeh1fGIldEkrJvyg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">一个45秒的视频，核心人物在这一集里都对齐了。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">确定好第二集的核心构思后，它会再次按照分镜脚本，人物图片，分镜视频，合成分镜，一连串搞定，第二集视频《共同战斗升级》：</span></span></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4603364220238446593\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4603364220238446593\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYDJvia7I4E6kKfsgbibA4yLhoQzF4vPCWnvbSDjMRIKPUbHOFzoffibIGEziagS0rI2CSYYIjPqw4MCfjdKAxXm8EjTcRZnkubLmmY%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">同样的思路，生成第三集《最终决战》：</span></span></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4603384251932131329\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4603384251932131329\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSxpC5raqFYCfOUVLicTbicBWlF7eINGLc3oyv4v7QiaeLG3uKfh3vnPOymekaWREUBvtQCr3cwCL7451k7QgfFgM4zNxv7qZbDl7TZcABpO7HM%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section><section><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">我仔细看了下三集剧情，故事叙事，人物主角展开的都很顺畅，</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://ww